//! The game around its Worlds in a headless `App` (`docs/plans/19-menus-and-saving.md`): the main
//! menu's actions, saving in play, and leaving a World, driven through `MenuAction`s as the
//! menus send them, with Worlds saved in a temporary folder.
//!
//! Worlds here are generated by the real world generator, under the shipped rules: a World's save
//! names its World Seed, and loading it rebuilds the generator from that. The simulation runs on
//! a thread of its own, so these tests wait in real time, with generous timeouts. The app's own
//! clock only moves when a test steps it, so play time is counted exactly.

